## solutions

#### iterative

```cpp
int sumList(Node* head) {
  Node* current = head;
  int total = 0;
  while (current != nullptr) {
    total += current->val;
    current = current->next;
  }
  return total;
}
```

- n = number of nodes
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(1)

#### recursive

```cpp
int sumList(Node* head) {
  if (head == nullptr) {
    return 0;
  }

  return head->val + sumList(head->next);
}
```

- n = number of nodes
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(n)
